---
import LocalTime from "../LocalTime.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container container--section">
    <h2>About me</h2>

    <div class="about__container">
      <div class="about__meta">
        <LocalTime size="lg" />
      </div>

      <div class="about__content">
        <p class="about__p">
          Hello, I'm Alexander Gabriel Ho. I'm a web developer who enjoys
          building things for the web and figuring out how they work. I focus on
          the small details that make a website polished, easy to use, and nice
          to look at.
        </p>
        <p class="about__p">
          Most of my work is on web applications, where I focus on clean
          structure and code that's easy to maintain. I like to keep things
          simple and clear, so both users and other developers can understand
          and use them easily.
        </p>
        <p class="about__p">
          I began learning programming in 2021. Initially, I was uncertain about
          what to study and how to proceed, but this confusion developed into a
          curiosity about the learning process. This curiosity led me to explore
          web development and continues to influence how I approach projects.
        </p>
        <p class="about__p">
          Over time, my interest evolved into building platforms that enable
          people to express themselves freely online. I am especially committed
          to creating accessible projects that promote openness, community, and
          honest expression.
        </p>
        <p class="about__p">
          At the end of the day, I really enjoy seeing how people use the stuff
          I build and finding little ways to make those experiences feel natural
          and enjoyable. For me, coding's just as much about experimenting and
          learning as it is about building, and I'm always looking for new ways
          to do both.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about__container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .about__container::after {
    content: "";
    display: block;
    clear: both;
  }

  .about__meta {
    float: none;
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm);
    order: 2;
  }

  .about__content {
    order: 1;
  }

  @media (--lg-viewport) {
    .about__container {
      display: block;
    }

    .about__meta {
      float: right;
      margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
      order: 0;
    }

    .about__content {
      order: 0;
    }
  }

  .about__p {
    font-weight: 500;
    text-align: justify;
  }
</style>
